OL,5,G0210 Daniel O'Connell - The Emancipator
OL,6,     FNew documentary celebrating the
OL,7,     Flife and legacy of Ireland's great
OL,8,     Fliberator on the 250th anniversary
OL,9,     Fof his birth.
OL,10,G0305 Imelda May - Amhrain na nGael
OL,11,     FImelda meets her sisters to share
OL,12,     Fexcitement for the journey ahead.
OL,13,     FAward-winning sean-nos singer
OL,14,     FLillis O Laoire is her guide, with
OL,15,     FLiam O Maonlai on hand for
OL,16,     Fcreative advice.
OL,17,G0330 The End Of The World With Beanz
OL,18,     FIn the wake of LA's devastating
OL,19,     FJanuary 2025 wildfires, Martin
OL,20,     FBeanz Warde and his Angeleno
OL,21,     Fco-host Samantha Mumba visit some
OL,22,     Fof the devastated neighbourhoods.
