OL,8,     Ffrom the banks and took ownership
OL,9,     Fof 12 of his victims houses.
OL,10,G0450 Heat My Home
OL,11,     FKieran meets Sylvia Thompson, a
OL,12,     Fretired speech and language
OL,13,     Ftherapist. Sylvia had enough of
OL,14,     Fthe cold in her 1950s era cottage
OL,15,     Fand used her savings to start a
OL,16,     Fretrofit project.
